{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o014b","title":"刘备遣诸葛亮孙权遣周瑜程普出军周瑜鲁肃主拒曹","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o014b-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"刘备遣诸葛亮孙权遣周瑜程普出军周瑜鲁肃主拒曹","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o014b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"遣使","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o014b-q"]},{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"奉使","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o014b-q"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"决策遣军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o014b-q"]},{"person":"zhou-yu","role":"主战","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o014b-q"]},{"person":"cheng-pu","role":"出军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o014b-q"]},{"person":"lu-su","role":"主战","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o014b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":208,"label":"刘表卒及赤壁战时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y208","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o012","basis":"刘表卒及赤壁战时"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o014b-q","wuzhu-q-o012","xunyu-q-o064","zhouyu-q-o009","zhouyu-q-b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o014b-q","source_order":[47,63,"O014b"],"order":8169}],"persons":[{"id":"cheng-pu","name":"程普","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"lu-su","name":"鲁肃","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhou-yu","name":"周瑜","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o014b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-5e943c9b5fe8a6b84c9b","layer":"original","quote":"备进住夏口〖12〗，使诸葛亮诣权〖13〗。权遣周瑜、程普等行。是时，曹公新得表众，形势甚盛；诸议者皆望风畏惧，多劝权迎之。﹝四﹞惟瑜、肃执拒之议，意与权同。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":78,"end":156},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o012","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-3843def972d8a772cdb3","layer":"original","quote":"十三年春〖1〗，权复征黄祖。祖先遣舟兵拒军，都尉吕蒙破其前锋；而凌统、董袭等尽锐攻之〖2〗，遂屠其城。祖挺身亡走〖3〗。骑士冯则追枭其首〖4〗，虏其男女数万口。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":80},{"id":"xunyu-q-o064","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-38f29d879d5ca24386ff","layer":"original","quote":"建安十三年，太祖破荆州，欲顺江东下。诩谏曰：“明公昔破袁氏，今收汉南；威名远著，军势既大。若乘旧楚之饶，以飨吏士；抚安百姓，使安土乐业；则可不劳众而江东稽服矣〖4〗。”太祖不从，军遂无利。﹝一﹞","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":314,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":97},{"id":"zhouyu-q-b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132","layer":"modern","quote":"〖6〗十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8f109f42647e5ee8d831","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o009","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-3661896c106f1817bf4b","layer":"original","quote":"十三年春〖6〗，权讨江夏，瑜为前部大督〖7〗。其年九月，曹公入荆州，刘琮举众降。曹公得其水军船，步兵数十万。将士闻之皆恐。（惧）〔权〕延见群下〖8〗，问以计策。议者咸曰：“曹公，豺虎也！然托名汉相，挟天子以征四方，动以朝廷为辞；今日拒之，事更不顺。且将军大势：可以拒操者，长江也。今操得荆州，奄有其地〖9〗；刘表治水军，蒙冲、斗舰〖10〗，乃以千数，操悉浮以沿江；兼有步兵，水陆俱下。此为长江之险，已与我共之矣。而势力众寡，又不可论。愚谓大计不如迎之。”","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":227}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
